0, and NVDA at ~$184.75 as of `2026-01-23T09:30:00-05:00`) provide attractive entry zones relative to their forward earnings power and fundamental secular growth.  4. **Risk-Adjusted Portfolio Positioning**:     - Deploying idle cash ($100,000.00 available) across these liquid large-cap leaders diversifies single-stock concentration risk while maintaining high return potential per unit of volatility compared to speculative small-cap alternatives.  ***  RESULT: Argued for the bull case of copying the visible congressional filing buys using range midpoints without submitting any orders." trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bull/98ed359a3217340b4376c81bd8cb404ee4725ada477a26dabed7497cdaea3edf-20260923034048234370.json
